# The Go server reads every device and can send commands.
user smarthouse-server
topic read smarthouse/+/state
topic read smarthouse/+/sample
topic read smarthouse/+/availability
topic write smarthouse/+/cmd

# Each device authenticates with a username equal to its device id, and may
# only publish its own state/sample/availability and read its own command topic.
pattern write smarthouse/%u/state
pattern write smarthouse/%u/sample
pattern write smarthouse/%u/availability
pattern read smarthouse/%u/cmd
